:: Widgets MP NPC Lin [widget nobr]
<<widget "mpInitNpcLin">>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, trustManor: 20, trustDomus: 20, trustHigh: 20, watch: 20, law: 0, clues: 0, caseStage: 0, deepStage: 0, witnessPages: 0, nextStepDay: 0, setback: 0, rep: 50, weekKey: -1, upkeepWeek: -1, relDay: 0 }>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.trustManor is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustManor to 20>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustDomus to 20>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.trustHigh is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.trustHigh to 20>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.watch is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.watch to 20>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.law is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.law to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.clues is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.clues to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.caseStage is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.caseStage to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.deepStage is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.deepStage to ($mpNpcs.lin.caseStage or 0)>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.witnessPages is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.witnessPages to ($mpNpcs.lin.clues or 0)>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.nextStepDay is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.nextStepDay to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.setback is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.setback to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.rep is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.rep to 50>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.weekKey is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.weekKey to -1>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.upkeepWeek is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.upkeepWeek to -1>><</if>>
<<if $mpNpcs.lin.relDay is undefined>><<set $mpNpcs.lin.relDay to 0>><</if>>
<</widget>>

:: MP NPC Lin Deep Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$mpLinEnded and ($mpWorldLinEnding or $mpWorldLinGym or $mpWorldLinCaptain)>><<set $mpWorldLinEnding to ($mpWorldLinCaptain ? "captain" : ($mpWorldLinEnding or "gym"))>><<set $mpLinEnded to 1>><</if>>
<<if $mpWorldLinEnding is "gym">><<set _wk to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>><<if (_lin.upkeepWeek or 0) isnot _wk>><<set _lin.upkeepWeek to _wk>><<money -25>><</if>><</if>>
<<if $mpAlert is undefined>><<mpalertinit "town">><</if>>
<<mpInitNpcCross>>
宅邸街与多姆斯街交界的守夜岗棚下，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>正对照怀表检查短棍卡扣，木案记着街区信赖 <<print _lin.watch>> 与旧案证言 <<print _lin.witnessPages>> 页。<<if (_lin.law or 0) gte 20>>他办案的手一年比一年硬。<<elseif (_lin.law or 0) lte -20>>他近来更愿给街坊留一步余地。<<else>>条文与人情在他笔下还没分出轻重。<</if>><<if $mpNpcCrossLast and $mpNpcCrossLast.lin>>值班簿夹着「<<print $mpNpcCrossLast.lin>>」的后续。<<else>>夜雾贴着石板路流动。<</if>><<if $mpWorldLinEnding is "gym">>自转办武馆后，每周要贴补一笔场租，官发巡防津贴也停了。<<elseif $mpWorldLinEnding is "captain">>自升任总队长后，民巷人情线便收紧了。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[查看作息表 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Schedule]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[查看夜巡案板 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Board]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[翻看旧案木板 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin Clue Board]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt (_lin.setback or 0)>>
<<link [[查看休整木牌 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Quest Closed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpLinEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldLinEnding is "captain">><<link [[重温总队终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin Ending Captain]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[重温武馆终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin Ending Gym]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>>
<<link [[去他现在所在 (0:05)|MP NPC Lin Schedule]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Lin Quest Waiting [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
岗棚的防风灯只拧开半寸火苗。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>合上抽屉，看了一眼怀表：霍克旧案只能在晚间十八点至二十三点换哨后私下查对，且每查一步都要隔天等风声过去。<<if (_lin.witnessPages or 0) lt 6 and (_lin.deepStage or 0) lt 5>>卷宗里的证言页眼下只攒了 <<print (_lin.witnessPages or 0)>> 页，还得靠每周夜巡结算一页页收齐。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回守夜总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[明晚再来问一次 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Quest Closed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
守夜岗棚的木窗从里面落了铁插销，门板外挂着总队督察室签发的「停职核查」白牌。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>隔着百叶窗低声让你先走：上次查案失手惊动了督察耳目，不仅折损了证言页与声望，这两天岗棚都被暗哨盯着，过两天再来接头。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回守夜总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[过两天再来看看 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Tier Action [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
守夜岗棚的铁皮炉上温着红糖姜汤，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>把擦亮的铜哨挂回胸前。当前三街区总信赖为 <<print (_lin.watch or 20)>>：<<if (_lin.watch or 0) gte 70>>各巷夜归人都认得你们的灯号，他已经把岗棚备用钥匙留了一把给你<<elseif (_lin.watch or 0) gte 30>>多姆斯街的住户见到你们会主动留门灯<<else>>街面上的商铺对夜巡哨卡还保持着几分审视<</if>>。
岗棚外的防风灯在湿石板上投下长影，远处的更声穿过夜雾悠悠传来。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[核对门锁记录 (0:12)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Board]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily.mpLinTierLock>><<set $daily.mpLinTierLock to 1>><<set _lin.trustDomus to Math.min(100, (_lin.trustDomus or 20) + 3)>><<set _lin.watch to Math.min(100, Math.round((_lin.trustManor + _lin.trustDomus + _lin.trustHigh) / 3))>><<mpalert -4>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[围铁炉饮热姜汤 (0:14)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 14>><<if !$daily.mpLinTierTea>><<set $daily.mpLinTierTea to 1>><<set _lin.love to Math.min(100, (_lin.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _lin.trustManor to Math.min(100, (_lin.trustManor or 20) + 3)>><<stress -4>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[在灯下擦亮旧铜哨 (0:10)|MP NPC Lin Daily 15]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Patrol Board [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopDay_lin isnot Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopDay_lin to Time.days>><<set $mpNpcLoopLock_lin to "none">><</if>>
岗棚案板上钉着三街区夜巡图：宅邸街信赖 <<print _lin.trustManor>>、多姆斯街 <<print _lin.trustDomus>>、高街商道 <<print _lin.trustHigh>>。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>点了点钟点：今晚要么走民巷与暗渠夜哨，要么去高街商铺查锁；本轮巡线<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_lin is "domus">>已锁定民巷纠纷，另三处哨位全数封线<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_lin is "canal">>已锁定暗渠夜哨，高街商铺已落闸封门<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_lin is "high">>已锁定高街查锁，暗渠铁栅已落锁<<elseif $mpNpcLoopLock_lin is "alley">>已锁定后巷暗箱，其余巷口都已换哨<<else>>尚未定线，选定一条便会关掉另外三条<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[巡民巷治安 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Case Group A]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<mptideicon>><<link [[下暗渠口夜哨 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Canal]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[赴高街查验库锁 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Patrol High]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<link [[摸排后巷走私暗箱 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Case Group B]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Patrol Canal [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<set _freshLinCanal to 0>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_lin is "none">>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_lin to "canal">><<set $mpLinPatrolDistrict to "manor">><<set _freshLinCanal to 1>>
你们顺着宅邸街后墙下到暗渠交界口，同日高街商道的巡铺时段随之错过。湿冷的水汽扑面而来，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>举灯照见铁栅边散落着半箱未贴税签的零件，暗处还有两名私枭眼线在试探你们的口风。
<<else>>
暗渠交界处的铁栅门已经由早班水工落了重锁，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>看了一眼怀表说，今晚的巡线窗口只够走一条街，你们已经把时辰耗在了别处。湿冷的水汽从栅缝里漫出来，这一班的换哨点早已错过，只能等明晚再排。
<</if>>
岗棚外的防风灯在湿石板上投下长影，远处的更声穿过夜雾悠悠传来。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回案板 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Board]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<if _freshLinCanal is 1>>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[按律查扣私货箱 (0:16)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<set $mpLinApproach to "law">><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[勒令退回记下暗记 (0:16)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<set $mpLinApproach to "mercy">><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看错失代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Lin Patrol High [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<set _freshLinHigh to 0>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_lin is "none">>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_lin to "high">><<set $mpLinPatrolDistrict to "high">><<set _freshLinHigh to 1>>
你们沿着高街商道逐户核验铜锁，同日暗渠交界口的换哨窗口随之关闭。丝绸铺后门果然留着一道被铁丝拨过的刮痕，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>示意你守住巷口，准备把潜伏在廊柱后的撬锁贼当场堵住。
<<else>>
高街商道的联防铁闸已经提前落下，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>停在钟表铺外的街角说，今晚的巡线只够走一条街，商铺掌柜们早已自行落锁歇业。廊柱后面那道被铁丝拨过的刮痕，只能留到明晚再查。
<</if>>
岗棚外的防风灯在湿石板上投下长影，远处的更声穿过夜雾悠悠传来。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回案板 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Board]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<if _freshLinHigh is 1>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[并肩擒拿撬锁贼 (0:18)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 18>><<set $mpLinApproach to "force">><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220 or (_lin.watch or 0) gte 40>><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><<else>><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 0>><</if>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[吹铜哨惊退撬锁贼 (0:14)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpLinApproach to "law">><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看错失代价 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Lin Patrol Lockout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
更钟把这一班切成两截：前半个钟点归暗渠，后半个钟点归高街，值班簿上只剩最后一格没划。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>把铜哨挂回钉子，说岗棚的排班是死的、人是活的，今晚这格空着，明晚换个班次照样能补上，硬折回去只会让两头都落空。他吹熄案头的灯，只在门框上留一盏给换哨的人认路。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回夜巡案板 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Board]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回守夜总枢 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Case Group A [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<set _freshLinA to 0>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_lin is "none">>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_lin to "domus">><<set $mpLinPatrolDistrict to "domus">><<set _freshLinA to 1>>
你与<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>并肩走在多姆斯街湿滑的石板路上，前方联排屋檐下传来争执声：两名醉酒的水手撞翻了夜班女工的煤筐，邻近住户的木窗半掩着不敢出声。他按住腰间短棍，低声问你这桩民巷纠纷按章严办还是顾全街坊人情。
<<else>>
多姆斯街的屋檐下已经安静下来，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>说今晚的巡线只够走一条街，撞翻煤筐的水手早被别处哨卡带走，街坊木窗也重新落了闩。你们沿主街收拢余下的门灯，留待明晚换班再补这一头。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回案板 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Board]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<if _freshLinA is 1>>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[按章铁面执法 (0:18)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 18>><<set $mpLinApproach to "law">><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><</link>><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[顾全街坊情调停 (0:18)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 18>><<set $mpLinApproach to "mercy">><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[果断出手震慑闹事 (0:18)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 18>><<set $mpLinApproach to "force">><<if ($physique or 0) gte 8500 or ($athletics or 0) gte 230>><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><<else>><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 0>><</if>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[巡线已封死 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Lin Case Group B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<set _freshLinB to 0>>
<<if $mpNpcLoopLock_lin is "none">>
<<set $mpNpcLoopLock_lin to "alley">><<set $mpLinPatrolDistrict to "high">><<set _freshLinB to 1>>
夜雾渐深，你与<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>穿过高街后巷的石砌拱廊。阴沟铁栅旁停着一辆没有挂牌的平板车，车上盖着油布的木箱散出刺鼻的桐油味，车轮辙印与三年前霍克旧案卷宗里记的一模一样。他压低风灯，等你决定怎样处置。
<<else>>
高街后巷的石砌拱廊里已经空无一人，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>说今晚的巡线只够走一条街，那辆没有挂牌的平板车早就顺着阴沟撤走，只剩地上一层新鲜的桐油印。你们记下辙痕走向，留待明晚再蹲守。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回案板 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Board]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<if _freshLinB is 1>>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[依律扣押木箱 (0:18)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 18>><<set $mpLinApproach to "law">><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><</link>><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[盘问车夫套线索 (0:18)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 18>><<set $mpLinApproach to "mercy">><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[顺车辙比对旧案簿 (0:12)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLinApproach to "mercy">><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[巡线已封死 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Lockout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<set _dist to ($mpLinPatrolDistrict or "domus")>>
<<set _WorldBonus to ($mpWorldLinEnding is "gym" ? -120 : ($mpWorldLinEnding is "captain" ? 150 : 0))>>
<<set _wk to Math.floor(Time.days / 7)>>
<<set _paid to 0>><<if !$daily.mpLinResolve>><<set $daily.mpLinResolve to 1>><<set _paid to 1>><</if>>
夜雾里的巡街交锋告一段落，岗棚防风灯映着湿滑的青石板，你们在值班簿上记下今夜的处置结果。
<<if $mpLinApproach is "law">>
<<if _paid is 1>>
<<if (_lin.weekKey or -1) isnot _wk>><<set _lin.weekKey to _wk>><<set _lin.witnessPages to Math.min(6, (_lin.witnessPages or 0) + 1)>><<set _lin.clues to _lin.witnessPages>><</if>>
<<set _lin.law to Math.clamp((_lin.law or 0) + 8, -100, 100)>>
<<if _dist is "manor">><<set _lin.trustManor to Math.min(100, (_lin.trustManor or 20) + 5)>><<elseif _dist is "high">><<set _lin.trustHigh to Math.min(100, (_lin.trustHigh or 20) + 5)>><<else>><<set _lin.trustDomus to Math.min(100, (_lin.trustDomus or 20) + 5)>><</if>>
<<set _lin.watch to Math.min(100, Math.round((_lin.trustManor + _lin.trustDomus + _lin.trustHigh) / 3))>>
<<set _pay to (450 + _WorldBonus)>><<money _pay>>
<<mpalert -6>><<stress -3>>
<</if>>
你们按章完成了现场取证移交，街坊对哨卡愈发信服，你也领到了当班巡防津贴与本周证言记录。
