:: MP NPC Lin Street Event [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
深夜的多姆斯街十字路口，贝利手下的收债马车与两名夜归学徒撞在一处，街区信赖当前为 <<print (_lin.watch or 20)>>。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>一步跨到马车前按住车辕，周围的百叶窗后有无数双眼睛正盯着守夜人敢不敢管这桩闲事。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[按律盘查马车 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 15>><<set $mpLinApproach to "law">><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><</link>><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[护送学徒走暗巷 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 15>><<set $mpLinApproach to "mercy">><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[并肩拔棍逼退马车 (0:16)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Resolve]]>><<pass 16>><<set $mpLinApproach to "force">><<if ($physique or 0) gte 8500 or (_lin.watch or 0) gte 50>><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 1>><<else>><<set $mpLinResolveOk to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Clue Board [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
软木板上钉着霍克旧案的铜哨拓片与红线。证言页攒了 <<print (_lin.witnessPages or 0)>> 页。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>说案子不在板上推，要在他巡街的钟点里碰见他才谈得开。
岗棚外的防风灯在湿石板上投下长影，远处更声穿过夜雾，短棍卡扣轻响一声。<br><br>
