:: MP NPC Lin Scene Finale [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if $mpLinEnded>><<if $mpWorldLinEnding is "captain">><<goto "MP NPC Lin Ending Captain">><<else>><<goto "MP NPC Lin Ending Gym">><</if>><</if>>
铁炉前摊齐六页证言。<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>看你：贴布告翻案开武馆，或进密室逼宫接总队。选定就不能回头。
岗棚外的防风灯在湿石板上投下长影，远处更声穿过夜雾，短棍卡扣轻响一声。<br><br>
