<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[进密室接总队 (0:20)|MP NPC Lin Ending Captain]]>><<pass 20>><<set $daily.mpLinScFinale to 1>><<set $mpLinIrreversibleChoice to "captain">><<set $mpLinEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldLinEnding to "captain">><<set _lin.law to Math.min(100, (_lin.law or 0) + 12)>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Ending Gym [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if $mpLinEnded and $mpWorldLinEnding is "captain">><<goto "MP NPC Lin Ending Captain">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpLinEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpLinEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldLinEnding to "gym">><<set $mpWorldLinGym to 1>><<set $mpWorldLinCaptain to 0>><<set $mpLinIrreversibleChoice to "gym">>
<<if !_already>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("lin_ending_gym_v40")>><<money 1800>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>
<<physique 6>><<athletics 4>><<stress -12>><<trauma -6>>
<</if>>
老霍克的冤情昭雪，宅邸街旧仓库正式挂出民间自卫武馆的木匾。脱下制服的<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>在天台为你留了专属的沙袋与藤椅，白昼教孤儿与街坊防身拳脚，入夜则并肩走过每一条暗巷。脱下官衣后，官发巡防津贴随之削减，武馆每周也要单支一笔场租。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回守夜总枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[上天台与他聊 (0:20)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 20>><<if !$daily.mpLinGymChat>><<set $daily.mpLinGymChat to 1>><<set _lin.love to Math.min(100, (_lin.love or 0) + 4)>><<stress -8>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[携他巡看三街灯火 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Board]]>><<pass 15>><<mpalert -8>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Ending Captain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if $mpLinEnded and $mpWorldLinEnding is "gym">><<goto "MP NPC Lin Ending Gym">><</if>>
<<set _already to ($mpLinEnded or 0)>>
<<set $mpLinEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldLinEnding to "captain">><<set $mpWorldLinCaptain to 1>><<set $mpWorldLinGym to 0>><<set $mpLinIrreversibleChoice to "captain">>
<<if !_already>>
<<set _lin.trustDomus to Math.max(0, (_lin.trustDomus or 20) - 5)>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("lin_ending_captain_v40")>><<money 2000>><<set $mpLanternOil to ($mpLanternOil or 0) + 2>><</if>>
<<mpalertclear>><<stress -8>>
<</if>>
<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>换上了笔挺的深黑总队长大衣，全城夜巡哨卡在他的铁腕整顿下井然有序，夜间犯罪与警戒被压到最低。虽然公务森严且旧案封存让多姆斯街的街坊多了几分疏远，但每当你路过岗亭，值班哨兵都会恭敬地替你放行。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回守夜总枢 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[领总队津贴款 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Board]]>><<pass 15>><<if !$mpLinCaptainBonus>><<set $mpLinCaptainBonus to 1>><<money 300>><<mpalert -10>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[随总队车巡视长街 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Street Event]]>><<pass 15>><<mpalert -8>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Schedule [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 12>>晨间岗棚里，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>在核门锁单，铜哨搁在砚台边。墨迹未干，砚台边还搁着昨夜的巡防回执，窗外石板被露水打湿。
<<elseif Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 18>>午后多姆斯街石阶上，他蹲着查消防水桶，短棍靠在墙根。水位浅了一截，街坊从门口探头，更声远远传来又散掉。
<<else>>入夜后高街与暗渠口之间，风灯一晃一晃，他按点换哨。铁栅上凝着潮气，短棍卡扣轻响，巷口没有第二盏灯。
<</if>>岗棚外的防风灯在湿石板上投下长影。<<if $mpWorldLinEnding is "gym">>武馆开张后，傍晚他常在仓库天台练拳。<<elseif $mpWorldLinEnding is "captain">>接任总队长后，巡查车准点走哨卡。<<else>>霍克旧案的卷宗还锁在抽屉里，红线钉在软木板上。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回岗棚 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if Time.days lt (_lin.setback or 0)>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[看停职通告 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Quest Closed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<elseif $mpLinEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldLinEnding is "captain">><<link [[回总队终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin Ending Captain]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[回武馆终局 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin Ending Gym]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<<else>>岗棚外防风灯在湿石板上拉出长影，更声穿过夜雾，短棍卡扣轻响。
<<if Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 12 and !$daily.mpLinScMorning>><<mpwatchicon>><<link [[帮核门锁单 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Scene Morning]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 18 and !$daily.mpLinScNoon>><<walkicon>><<link [[查消防水桶 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Scene Noon]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif (Time.hour gte 18 or Time.hour lt 6) and !$daily.mpLinScNight>><<mplampicon>><<link [[跟他换夜哨 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Scene Night]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<elseif !$daily.mpLinScTea>><<tendingicon>><<link [[围炉喝姜汤 (0:10)|MP NPC Lin Scene Tea]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<else>><<walkicon>><<link [[去街口走走 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin Street 5]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<if (_lin.deepStage or 0) gte 5 and (_lin.witnessPages or 0) gte 6 and !$mpLinEnded and !$daily.mpLinScFinale and Time.days gte (_lin.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mpscaleicon>><<link [[在铁炉前决断 (0:16)|MP NPC Lin Scene Finale]]>><<pass 16>><</link>>
<<elseif (_lin.witnessPages or 0) gte 6 and !$daily.mpLinScWit6 and Time.days gte (_lin.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[摊齐六页证言 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Scene Wit6]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_lin.love or 0) gte 40 or (_lin.trust or 0) gte 40) and !$daily.mpLinScRel40 and Time.days gte (_lin.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[跟他回值班室 (0:20)|MP NPC Lin Scene Rel40]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<<elseif (_lin.rep or 50) lt 30 and !$daily.mpLinScRepLow and Time.days gte (_lin.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[应付督察盘问 (0:12)|MP NPC Lin Scene RepLow]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif (_lin.rep or 50) gte 70 and !$daily.mpLinScRepHigh and Time.days gte (_lin.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[收下街坊谢礼 (0:12)|MP NPC Lin Scene RepHigh]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif (_lin.witnessPages or 0) gte 4 and !$daily.mpLinScWit4 and Time.days gte (_lin.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[比对铁栏锯痕 (0:15)|MP NPC Lin Scene Wit4]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_lin.love or 0) gte 25 or (_lin.trust or 0) gte 25) and !$daily.mpLinScRel25 and Time.days gte (_lin.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[并肩靠岗棚 (0:14)|MP NPC Lin Scene Rel25]]>><<pass 14>><</link>>
<<elseif (_lin.witnessPages or 0) gte 2 and !$daily.mpLinScWit2 and Time.days gte (_lin.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[对读两页证言 (0:12)|MP NPC Lin Scene Wit2]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<elseif ((_lin.love or 0) gte 10 or (_lin.trust or 0) gte 10) and !$daily.mpLinScRel10 and Time.days gte (_lin.nextStepDay or 0)>><<mphearticon>><<link [[接过热姜汤 (0:12)|MP NPC Lin Scene Rel10]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>><<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[核对关系阶位 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin Tier Action]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Lin Note [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcCross>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
你走近守夜人岗棚时木门紧掩，防风灯下压着一张字迹工整的值班便条：<<if (_lin.watch or 0) gte 70>>『我去暗渠复核旧案水尺，保温壶里给你留了热红糖姜汤，备用钥匙在第三块青砖下，二十一点整点回来见。』<<elseif (_lin.watch or 0) gte 30>>『去多姆斯街调停邻里门锁，岗棚檐下留了干毛巾，整点换班时回。』<<else>>『外出巡街，有急事请敲岗棚铜铃，整点归哨。』<</if>>
岗棚外的防风灯在湿石板上投下长影，远处的更声穿过夜雾悠悠传来。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回作息 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[签巡防回执 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<if !$daily.mpLinNoteSign>><<set $daily.mpLinNoteSign to 1>><<set _lin.watch to Math.min(100, (_lin.watch or 20) + 2)>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[前往同城交集 (0:06)|MP NPC Cross Lin Hub]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Street 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
<<set _first to !$daily.mpNpcStreetLin5>><<set $daily.mpNpcStreetLin5 to 1>>
多姆斯街与高街交界的石阶拐角处，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>正站在路灯下帮一个迷路的小报童核对门牌号。当前街区信赖为 <<print (_lin.watch or 20)>>：<<if (_lin.watch or 0) gte 50>>路过的面包房掌柜热情地招呼你们进屋喝热茶，他笑着把自己的围巾解下来替你挡住巷口冷风<<else>>他认真记下报童要去的那户门牌，抬头见你来了便示意你一同顺路护送<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回上一页 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Schedule]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[送小报童回家 (0:10)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if _first>><<set _lin.trustDomus to Math.min(100, (_lin.trustDomus or 20) + 2)>><<set _lin.trust to Math.min(100, (_lin.trust or 0) + 2)>><<tiredness 1>><<stress -2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[顺路查消防水桶 (0:12)|MP NPC Lin Patrol Board]]>><<pass 12>><<if _first>><<mpalert -2>><<set _lin.love to Math.min(100, (_lin.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _lin.trust to Math.min(100, (_lin.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Lin Daily 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpInitNpcLin>>
<<set _lin to $mpNpcs.lin>>
岗棚木桌上摊着绒布与擦铜膏，<<if _lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>把巡夜铜哨与备用手电拆开保养。当前街区信赖为 <<print (_lin.watch or 20)>>：<<if (_lin.watch or 0) gte 50>>他把一枚刻着岗棚编号的副哨穿在皮绳上递给你，说夜里不管在哪条巷子吹响，他三分钟内必到<<else>>他手把手教你辨认一长两短的紧急联络哨音，免得夜雾太大走散<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回分层互动 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Tier Action]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[细擦铜哨簧片 (0:10)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyLin15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyLin15 to 1>><<set _lin.trustDomus to Math.min(100, (_lin.trustDomus or 20) + 2)>><<set _lin.love to Math.min(100, (_lin.love or 0) + 1)>><<tiredness 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[给手电换新电池 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin Deep Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<if !$daily.mpNpcDailyLin15>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyLin15 to 1>><<set _lin.trustHigh to Math.min(100, (_lin.trustHigh or 20) + 1)>><<money 30>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress -1>><</if>><</link>>
